2. All the pendants are color YB and have values 1-4.  There are 0-3 subsidiaries on each.  One, and only one, of the subsidiaries is BS.
(Previous sentence should read: ""One, and only one, of the subsidiaries ON EACH is BS."")",quipu,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False
