With the exception of the peculiar first pendant, all pendant values are 0, 1, 2, or 3.",quipu,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,True,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False
KH0072,"1. This quipu is associated with quipus AS059-AS067.  See discussion under AS059.
