3. The top cord is the color of the pendant cords, and its value is the sum of the pendant values.  The subsidiary is the color of the subsidiaries on the pendants, and its value is the sum of the subsidiary values.",quipu,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,True,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,True,False
KH0073,"1. Construction note [on pendant 6]: At 27.0 cm. there is a knot on this subsidiary.  Pendant 6 is slipped though the knot.
2. This quipu is associated with quipus AS059-AS067.  See discussion under AS059.
3. By spacing, there are 8 groups.  Each group has 2 pendants with one subsidiary on each pendant.  With the exception of one subsidiary, all groups have the same color pattern: W sub KB, KB sub W.  
4. With the exception of one blank pendant (P1 in group 5), and one broken pendant of unknown value (P2 in group 6), for all groups: 6 </= P1 </= 9; 6 </= P1 + P1s1 </= 10; 10 </= P2 </= 15; 14 </= P2 + P2s1 </= 20; 23 </= P1 + P1s1 + P2 + P2s2 </= 29
5. Double long knots appear on 4 of the 8 white subsidiaries.",quipu,True,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False
KH0065,"1. Construction note: Start of main cord is turned back and inserted between strands to form a closed loop of 1.0 cm.
2. The Museum records the provence as Hacienda Ullujalla y Callengo.  All of the quipus AS051-AS056 have the same attribution.
3. Pendant 1 and all 4 subsidiaries are made of wooly animal hair rather than cotton.  All subsidiaries are the same color.
4. There are 4 groups of 2, 5, 9, 5 pendants by spacing.  Group 3 has all pendants of one color.  Groups 2 and 4 have the same number of pendants, the same color pendants in positions 1 (YB) and positions 4 (DB-YB), and the same value (430) in the last position.
5. Long knots appear only on 2 subsidiaries.  On all other cords, only s knots are used.  Values have, therefore, been interpreted depending on placement of knots with the assumption that the lowest position is units.",quipu,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,True,False,False,False,True,False,False,False,False
KH0013,"1. Construction note: MB is joined to W at 7 cm. consistantly.
