KH0020,"1. Construction note: In group 2, the first and second pendant are paired and the third and fourth pendant are paired by special construction. (a) A double length cord was bent in half, (b) and then slipped through itself around main cord forming 2 adjacent pendants. (See Ascher notes page 62.)
