4. The values on AS35D repeat values on AS35A and B.  The values on AS35A are limited to 17, 11, 14, and the first 3 pendant values on AS35D are 12 with a subsidiary of 5 (total 17), 11, 14.  AS35B is limited to 4 values - 10, 22, 26, 34 - and the second group of pendants on AS35D have the same colors and the quite similar values of 10, 21, 26, 34.
